BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:82b1475a250bbc0f@delhi-events
DTSTAMP:20260920T105600Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261003
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261004
SUMMARY:If Trees Could Write
LOCATION:KNMA\, New Delhi\, Kiran Nadar Museum of Art\, Saket\, New Delhi
  110017
URL:https://www.knma.org/whats-on/workshops/if-trees-could-write
DESCRIPTION:Create a handmade zine that brings together plants\, stories\
 , drawings\, and personal observations. Inspired by Inheritors of Earth a
 nd its exploration of phytography\, or plant-writing\, the workshop invit
 es families to discover how plants and trees can carry stories\, memories
 \, and ideas. Using a simple folded-booklet format\, participants combine
  drawing\, collage\, and writing to create their own visual narratives. W
 hat stories might a tree hold? How might a leaf carry traces of a place\,
  or a tree become a living archive of memory? Using these questions as st
 arting points\, participants gather observations\, ideas\, and personal r
 eflections\, bringing together plant forms\, words\, images\, and stories
 . The workshop encourages families to slow down\, observe closely\, share
  stories\, and experiment with language and visual expression. Each famil
 y creates a unique zine shaped by their own observations and interpretati
 ons of plant life\, memory\, and place.\n\nhttps://www.knma.org/whats-on/
 workshops/if-trees-could-write
CATEGORIES:workshop\,nature
END:VEVENT
